[TITLE]
;;Project Title/Notes
MODEL: Surrogate sewer model to simulate combined wastewater discharge from RUSSIKON incl. RUB Morgental.
DATA: Size of the catchment area is provided by Ing.-büro Wiesendanger AG, M. Congiu (2013) - BSc Thesis; data on the CSO Morgental from the city of Fehraltorf (to be treated CONFIDENTIAL!).
CALIBRATION: Catchment outlet (node 11d) corresponds to UWO monitoring location 'f03' (Veloweg);
Dry weather flow is derived from flow observations at 'f03';
Stormwater runoff is represented through one lumped (virtual) subcatchment 'sc1_rus' accounting for 50ha connected area with 35% degree of imperviousness (Russikon)
RDII flow component is represented by one virtual subcatchment (rdii1).
Calibration is done for Mar16 - Sep16 with r02 rain and f03 flow observations.
Frank Blumensaat, 29-Aug-2017.

